# TrendPullback_Fibo.seq — trend-following pullback entry
#
# Trade idea: an established trend (Nexis MA agrees AND the regression
# channel says quality — B1+B6) is a standing precondition, so it guards
# Step 1 rather than being a step of its own. The AutoFibo gate (T2)
# fires when price pulls back into a fib level — that ARMS the chase.
# Then a pattern (T1) or hidden CCC pattern (T9) must confirm within
# 8 bars. Losing channel quality (B6 flip) invalidates the whole chase:
# a pullback in a degrading channel is not the trade.
#
# Note WIN:0 on Step 1 — we will wait at a quality trend indefinitely;
# the clock only starts once the pullback fires.
# STATUS: ILLUSTRATIVE — Phase 6a target format; not yet parsed.

KIND=SEQ NAME=TrendPullback_Fibo RR=2.5 TRAIL=on
STEP1 = GUARD:B1+B6 ADV:T2     WIN:0  INV:NONE
STEP2 = GUARD:B1    ADV:T1|T9  WIN:8  INV:B6
